## Markov Chain Monte Carlo (MCMC)

Common MCMC algorithms include 

::: {.incremental}

- Gibbs sampler
- Metropolis-Hastings
- random walk Metropolis
- Hessian Monte Carlo
- No-U-Turns (NUTS)

:::

::: {.fragment}

NUTS is what the software *Stan* uses, which is under the hood of the R code we'll use

